## Interoperability

The plugin interoperates with the user's own locally installed QwenWork desktop account and the
public HTTP API at gateway.qwenwork.ai and the minted MaaS upstream. No QwenWork source code or
assets are included in this repository. The plugin is read-only on QwenWork data: it never writes
auth-v2.dat, Local State or any other app file, and it never calls the refresh-token flow.

## magpie plugin specification

The plugin follows the magpie plugin documentation (https://usemagpie.ai/docs/zh/plugins) and is an
OpenCode v1 style provider plugin.

